@startuml use-case
title Smart Campus study room booking - Use-case diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "Search Available Rooms" as UC1
  usecase "Book Room" as UC2
  usecase "Cancel Own Booking" as UC3
  usecase "Block Room" as UC4
  usecase "Unblock Room" as UC5
  usecase "Review Room Usage" as UC6
}

' Student goals
Student -- UC1 : US-01
Student -- UC2 : US-02, US-06
Student -- UC3 : US-03

' Administrator goals
UC4 -- Administrator : US-04
UC5 -- Administrator : US-05
UC6 -- Administrator : scenario

note bottom of UC2
  Enforces R1 (future start, 0 < duration <= 2 h),
  R2 (no overlap for same room),
  R3 (blocked room refused),
  R4 (confirmation on success).
  US-06 (refuse > 2 h) is the R1
  rejection flow of this use case.
end note

note bottom of UC4
  R3: a blocked room accepts
  no new bookings.
end note

note bottom of UC6
  From the scenario text;
  no approved story yet.
end note
@enduml
